公曰：世之傳酈生書，多曰漢王已拔三秦，東擊項籍而引軍於鞏洛之閒，酈生被儒衣往說漢王。乃非也。自沛公未入關，與項羽別而至高陽，得酈生兄弟。余讀陸生新語書十二篇，固當世之辯士。至平原君子與余善，是以得具論之。"}],"rationale":"按酈生、陸賈與朱建分傳及敘事承接限定異稱；尉他尉佗原字分存。平原君據明示朱建另候選；朱建兩處未名子尚不合併，淮陰侯與單稱韓信跨篇同指待證。引語古王及神話人物與當事人分開。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:p024","text":"太史公曰：世之傳酈生書，多曰漢王已拔三秦，東擊項籍而引軍於鞏洛之閒，酈生被儒衣往說漢王。乃非也。自沛公未入關，與項羽別而至高陽，得酈生兄弟。余讀陸生新語書十二篇，固當世之辯士。至平原君子與余善，是以得具論之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"cez_le6_frl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"項籍","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"jz7_3ie_0jf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"50g_j9s_2le","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"酈生","kind":"person","person_id":"exh_47e_0gw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"陸生","kind":"person","person_id":"fjo_zh4_b7q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-097-luli:m024-0089","start":89,"en